<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1663) <span class="when">Oct 16, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Everything a showcase visit recorded, one click away.</b> In the Review Manager, the arrow beside a visit opens all it recorded: place to the postal code and approximate position, time zone, network and its number, device ID, channel and referring page, playback details, the seconds watched and that visit&#8217;s own plays per second. The network and where the viewer came from now show on every visit, and the viewing CSV has them as columns.</li>
<li><b>Showcase figures.</b> On the studio&#8217;s own Macs, under the list: every showcase&#8217;s visits, time watched, finishes and closing-link clicks for the last week, month, quarter or year, by showcase, company, network, channel, referring site and country.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
